  "content": "\n\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/498/54/logo_and_title.png\" alt=\"投射物傷害屬性\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Fabric | Forge-ecebe6?labelColor=263768&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"模組載入器\"></a>\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available-1.18.2 | 1.19 | 1.19.1 | 1.19.2| 1.19.3 | 1.19.4 | 1.20.1-ecebe6?labelColor=263768&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"支援版本\">\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric_API-REQUIRED-ecebe6?labelColor=263768&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"需要 Fabric API\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CLIENT_SIDE_INSTALLATION-REQUIRED-ecebe6?labelColor=263768&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"環境：客戶端\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/SERVER_SIDE_INSTALLATION-REQUIRED-ecebe6?labelColor=263768&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"環境：伺服器端\">\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/tXb7cYhV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/973561601519149057.svg?label=&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&color=7389D8&labelColor=6A7EC2&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord 社群\"></a></p>\n<h3>☕️ 如果您喜歡我的專案，歡迎在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fdaedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-Fi</a> 上支持我</h3>\n<p>‌</p>\n<h1>🏹️ 功能</h1>\n<p>為遊戲新增了一個新的實體屬性（EntityAttribute），其 ID 為：<code>projectile_damage:generic</code>。這允許您自訂遊戲中個別弓與弩物品的傷害值。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/477/981/projectile_tooltip_improved.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/477/982/crossbow_tooltip.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>‌</p>\n<p>新增了名為 <em>衝擊力</em> 的狀態效果，可提升實體造成的投射物傷害。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/496/33/screenshot-2022-09-12-at-21.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>指令範例：<code>/effect give @p projectile_damage:impact 30 4</code></p>\n<p>‌</p>\n<p>您也可以使用本模組提供的 API，來設定您自訂遠程武器的傷害值。</p>\n<h1>🔧 設定</h1>\n<p><strong>伺服器端</strong>設定檔可在安裝模組並啟動遊戲後，於 <code>config</code> 資料夾中找到。</p>\n<h1>🔨 作為模組開發者使用</h1>\n<p>更多詳細資訊請查看專案的 <a href=\"https://github.com/ZsoltMolnarrr/ProjectileDamage\" rel=\"nofollow\">說明文件（README）</a>。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
